  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPO Social and Human Sciences Sector- Nairobi Office</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The JPO will be under the direct supervision of the Programme Specialist for SHS. The Unit implements SHS Programme in the 13 countries of the region, including, but not limited to Knowledge generation, creation and dissemination for social transformations in Africa (MOST component); youth development and empowerment; inclusion and Human Rights; Intercultural Dialogue and Culture of Peace; Bioethics and Ethics of Science and Technologies. The JPO will also be involved in intersectoral collaboration, as well as engagement with other UN agencies, in joint endeavors towards delivery as one, under the close monitoring of the supervisor.</narrative>
  </description>
